Package: IsletCalc
Title: Calculators for Insulin and Glucagon Release Indices
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Sufyan", "Suleman", email = "sufyansuleman@hotmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-6612-6915"))
Description: Facilitates the calculation of validated pancreatic islet
    hormone-release indices from fasting and oral glucose tolerance test
    (OGTT) measurements. Provides beta-cell insulin release indices
    (including HOMA-beta, corrected insulin response, Stumvoll first-phase
    index, BIGTT-AIR, and disposition indices) as described in
    Madsen (2024) <doi:10.1038/s42255-024-01140-6>, alongside alpha-cell
    glucagon release and glucagon resistance indices derived from the
    glucagon-suppression and liver-alpha-cell-axis literature. Enables
    reproducible assessment of beta-cell and alpha-cell function for
    metabolic and endocrine research.
